G->H; H->D[label $=$ "Yes"]; H->I[label $=$ "No”]； I->F; } ... {image}

# A.3 Prompt 3: Flowchart to PlantUML

Task: Convert the provided flowchart into a PlantUML representation.

# Prompt template:

Generate the PlantUML code for the provided flowchart.

```txt
